Here are the domain objects:
```json
{
  "domain objects": [
    {
      "name": "Manager",
      "description": "Oversees consulting projects and manages relationships with clients."
    },
    {
      "name": "Client",
      "description": "Organization representative seeking consulting services.",
      "attributes": [
        "Organization"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Organization",
      "description": "The client’s company or institution being analyzed."
    },
    {
      "name": "Consulting Project",
      "description": "Engagement between consultants and client to deliver improvements.",
      "attributes": [
        "Consultant",
        "Client"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Consultant",
      "description": "Provides professional advice and creates project proposals."
    },
    {
      "name": "Progress Report",
      "description": "Summary of project status and progress submitted to the manager."
    },
    {
      "name": "Proposal",
      "description": "Document outlining improvement strategies and an engagement plan.",
      "attributes": [
        "Engagement Plan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Engagement Plan",
      "description": "Detailed plan describing project scope, deliverables, and timeline."
    },
    {
      "name": "Analysis Session",
      "description": "Collaborative meeting where data is reviewed and discussed."
    },
    {
      "name": "Reporter",
      "description": "Collects and analyzes data to support consulting recommendations."
    },
    {
      "name": "Data Report",
      "description": "Report summarizing data analysis and findings for client presentations."
    },
    {
      "name": "Feedback",
      "description": "Client’s evaluation of consulting outcomes and recommendations."
    },
    {
      "name": "Follow Up Meeting",
      "description": "Meeting between manager and client to discuss future collaboration."
    }
  ]
}
```
